- Two vendor unknowns from the briefing both resolved: Zeke's Superior Scimitars stock
  table gives Mithril as the top tier (stock 1, restock 4000s), and Jatix's Herblore Shop
  in Taverley sells vial-of-water packs (stock 750, restock 100s) -- both non-GE, both
