- CANONICAL-TRIGGER MINT: the brief should have said "before starting, grep your owned
  step ids against assets/data/tools/steps.jsonl (not just contrib/queue) -- ids missing
  from steps.jsonl entirely are real authoring gaps (tests/fixtures may already reference
